# Production security headers — Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets.
# This file is copied from public/ into dist/ at build time.
#
# NOTE: Content-Security-Policy is intentionally OMITTED. The calculator
# pages rely on inline scripts (gtag config + legacy-host redirect in the
# Layout head, and Astro-bundled inline module scripts in each calculator
# component), and the one external script is loaded from
# https://www.googletagmanager.com. A CSP without 'unsafe-inline' would
# break every calculator on the site, and allowing 'unsafe-inline' would
# make the policy near-worthless. Revisit if scripts are ever extracted
# to same-origin .js files and hashed.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
